{"operations":[{"content":"# Signature limit\n\nA single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only. This limit is set by the CFO directive of 1 July 2026 and applies until further notice.\n\nWhere the CFO directive and the procurement policy differ, the CFO directive applies.\n\nThe procurement policy states that a single signature suffices for purchases up to two thousand (2000) EUR.\n\n[[cite:obs-3afce953e4a41020627be9af58a82190db3dd99c \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]]\n[[cite:obs-eef62688e3ca398b302eaa4d6e63c2ff5a20a53a \"A single signature suffices for purchases up to two thousand (2000) EUR.\"]]","expected_sha256":"8d07a5c6ace44eef23c8280dc7333792f980c8e8ce718a47376785505b32009c","kind":"modify","path":"doc/signature_limit.md"}],"rationale":"Added the single-signature purchase limit from the CFO directive and noted that it overrides the procurement policy where they differ, with exact citations from both sources."}